{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "fe0f03ebb06f3c3e3a8725aaa6dde79b5bd59bfba1aafa10736676095ceb9d62", "ja": "魅梨音闘争篇　～流浪～", "zh": "魅梨音斗争篇 ～流浪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bf03c042b15997d01a526dae48c1d5563496350c5c6a505ae447e87681e51064", "ja": "任俠組織・魅梨音組の組長が、構成員ののり\n子に殺された。娘の桃子と子分の環を残し、\n組は離散。そんなある日、ふたりは行き倒れ\nのジュリアを助ける。ジュリアは、世話にな\nった組長に挨拶に来たと告げるのだった。", "zh": "任侠组织·魅梨音组的组长被组员纪子杀害了。女儿桃子和手下环被留下，组也就此解散。\n某天，两人救下了倒在路边的\n茱莉亚。茱莉亚告诉她们，自己是来向曾经照顾过自己的组长问候的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "27e89e585e122c930487e5c56cff37f6c002b7798cee93b704bab88ca7483c66", "ja": "「極道たちが鎬を削る無法の時代。義理と人情は忘れ\n去られて久しく、弱肉強食の理が人々を支配していた」", "zh": "「那是黑道之间激烈争斗的无法时代。道义与人情早已被人遗忘，弱肉强食的法则支配着人们」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "3f727a77d0b4f48233a391b6a6617b43536ed570f9a855ac596ae2a2a40d5144", "ja": "「魅梨音組は、戦前から七六五市にシマを持つ、\n由緒正しい任俠組織であった。しかし……」", "zh": "「魅梨音组，是自战前起便在七六五市拥有地盘的、\n底蕴深厚的任侠组织。然而……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1002_se", "source_sha256": "bf8877e12b5ade36e968492fdd03d52381c3fc63f71822abf5e631b0dc92bb61", "ja": "ドスッ！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "aca663ef15cde831d398900136a2914aaafc7c5989f20af786f84ad41466e8f6", "ja": "……はぁ……はぁ……。", "zh": "……哈……哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "4593a1ee1de3c07168fc6b0f305c9021c8f14c4ebb34815778e91763c6260c8d", "ja": "あっけないもんだね。人の命なんてさ\n魅梨音組組長、たまはもらったよ。", "zh": "真是脆弱啊。人的性命这种东西……\n魅梨音组组长，你的命我收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "fb3c7bce432e39ecc89cc1ccdb4454e3da59dee652cef63fcfa02151dd92f35f", "ja": "おやぶん！　今の物音はいったい……！\nえっ！？　……のりこ！？", "zh": "老大！刚才那声音到底是……！\n诶！？……法子！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "c8c5a51995be5a8f8fbc15c46c810eceda5f6ce268e2ece6fb204e713f657e99", "ja": "環。見られたか。", "zh": "环。被看到了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "6ab499f4860c5113bcd1f6c19548e8bf9f0e54842fd2774154a0fde1ec6a473b", "ja": "……おやぶん！　おやぶんーっ！\n目を開けて、おやぶんーっ！！", "zh": "……老大！老大——！\n快睁开眼睛啊，老大——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "949ab200f73e5d14687021ac6c2d4f7349f25753d4fb6a51a6bb4c951173d4b0", "ja": "「その年の9月、魅梨音組組長が就寝中を襲われ、\n刺殺された。下手人は元魅梨音組構成員、福田のり子」", "zh": "“同年9月，魅梨音组组长于就寝时遇袭，\n被刺身亡。凶手为原魅梨音组组员，福田法子”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "70dc91e4f03926a4dbb3dcea3298974a6ab8f4ef320ee0c09c727614fdb2c967", "ja": "「日頃から木下組の後塵を拝していた魅梨音組にとって\nこの攻撃は、決定的なものとなった」", "zh": "「对于平日里就屈居木下组之下的魅梨音组来说，\n这次袭击成为了决定性的打击」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "615c780dc833b060b4c0106aadee15a637d2c24660f94d0a8081ae053f3d3ce6", "ja": "みんないなくなっちゃったね。", "zh": "大家都走光了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "4b22557d59ee35041ad7b9b824f2510306e7d0c3b1da2dc6291e39507eb8aff5", "ja": "まだおやぶんの四十九日も\n終わってないっていうのに、どうして……。", "zh": "明明老大的头七都\n还没过完，为什么会这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "e4731b644f78a092c5f9d26d328a387c6e05050dde195cb953cefdf48332408f", "ja": "仕方ないよ。親分がいなくなった組と心中なんてして\nられないもん。この世界じゃ、それが当たり前なの。", "zh": "没办法。不能陪着亲分不在了的那一组一起走向毁灭。这个世界就是这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "86834bcf6d3fe1360285f8fe571936de660ea2aad68c3bbaa88914eb417013fe", "ja": "あれ？　お嬢、あそこ。\n誰か、寄っかかってるみたい。", "zh": "咦？大小姐，你看那边。\n好像有人靠在那里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "1d8377ec0dc48713d0546459cbe3a05c903757099cccf080defe3334c5ff8a55", "ja": "うぅ……もう……だめ……。", "zh": "呜……已经……不行了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "ac7a9bbef7ea63a19b5a024e79425cfdcee1dec62fbf14519fdc797a70e4d3bd", "ja": "あっ、倒れちゃった！？\nだいじょうぶ？　しっかりしてっ！", "zh": "啊，倒下去了！？\n没事吧？振作一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "b612ff0f097d8a7fb9afaa70a33ed116c89bf7fa0761380f27f6f69fc828c98a", "ja": "うん、こんなにうまいメシを食ったのは久しぶりだ！\nごちそうさん！", "zh": "嗯，好久没吃到这么好吃的饭了！多谢款待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "ec5da00916d248d5c4c8ab23e44faf3e373258d3806e163a7cb65056480face4", "ja": "悪いね。介抱してもらった上に、\nこんなごちそうまでいただいちゃってさ。", "zh": "不好意思。让你照顾我不说，\n还吃了这么丰盛的一餐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "fab104c84c6a5e94e95cb15144680d3d8f2d7dedf00d3f456608080dd80f2c7c", "ja": "しょうがないでしょ。あのまま死なれたら、寝覚めが\n悪いもん……。それで、うちにいったい何の用？", "zh": "没办法啊。要是就那样死了，我也会良心不安，\n所以，你来我家到底有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "3ab2a4e399d93dec3d25481b421c9436932665baf75e9b2f868dfba045b35aa2", "ja": "ああ。昔、こちらの親分さんに、ちょいとお世話に\nなったんだ。近くに寄ったんで挨拶しようと思ってさ。", "zh": "啊。以前承蒙这边的老大照顾过。正好路过附近，就想着来打个招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c81647e1671973ad909540647ce015878f64911ee88c853789a9d61f0ab7ec9", "ja": "お父さんに？", "zh": "你是说爸爸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "db35a4a0325b821141f243348b7c7a08ec41fa23c7dc4e006215f7531bf3380c", "ja": "お父さん？　……へえ！　まさか親分さんに、こんな\nべっぴんな娘さんがいたなんてね。こいつはいいや。", "zh": "父亲？……嘿！没想到老大您还有这么漂亮的女儿啊。这可真不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "5724051490ac54f61a6d2645b3597c7bc246dabadb5262666b4edd0783b11f32", "ja": "おっと、自己紹介がまだだったよな。\n……ちょいと軒先、お借りしてもいいかい？", "zh": "哎呀，还没自我介绍呢。\n……能借用一下门口吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "b55c827ade138e3857ace42aa30e6ae21f89f4a292aa42834aeb5d68195f2c3c", "ja": "御控えください。\n私は旅のしがないものでござんす。御控えください。", "zh": "请留步。\n在下不过是个微不足道的江湖过客。还请留步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "e2482c0cf6ae549ea5f9fcc7bd28bc565089d25b474f89376e3641e335216f60", "ja": "な、なに？", "zh": "怎、怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "e955072208126f8c6af3fc749c4f2608729ab511e91702d8d77882a469c5ed8b", "ja": "ご当家、三尺三寸借りうけまして、\n稼業、仁義を発します。", "zh": "借贵家三尺三寸之地，容我按本行规矩报上名号。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "4e83b28865fd70f953751a356fd9a0ea66f87d4c898bac6a1133feb4d2cbfc6b", "ja": "えっ、ええと……あ、ありがとうございます。\n控えさせていただきます。", "zh": "呃，那个……啊，谢谢您。我就先退下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "f2c2ac0c171f84f139cd3a718753aff10c3db0c1e31526d1c5ce9c2c00b2d050", "ja": "さっそく御控えあって、ありがとうござんす。", "zh": "谢谢您这么快就让开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "2337fb2cba74e74e9814f3fb932b62201659c0ac8348864eae38d93a65d5e5d3", "ja": "御挨拶、失礼さんでござんすが御免なさんせ。向かい\nましたる上さんと、今回初めてのお目通りでござんす。", "zh": "承蒙海涵，容我失礼自报家门。\n在下与对面的当家，还是初次拜见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "7d2d337d7af647a0d7bd7a3cac7f5ce178288f8e3051b404e5857162c4312da7", "ja": "日の本の端に生まれ落ち、産湯を出てから西へ東へ。\n故郷と共に姓を捨て、ただ名をジュリアと発します。", "zh": "出生于日之本的边陲，自打出了产汤，便一路漂泊于东西。随故乡一并舍弃了姓氏，只报上名讳，叫作茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "17d286eb6d3af8ac7e255fa4377dc769a853d9d024b704114e555d62fc5a429b", "ja": "ご賢察の通り、しがない根無し草にございます。\nどうかお見知りおかれ、ご昵懇に願います。", "zh": "正如您所料，我不过是个微不足道的无根浮萍。还请记住我，今后多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "838b6132e68b362ee295eac405ce015ad487ce0ef9a73ed28693d5243564772a", "ja": "え？　う、うん……。\n桃子は、周防桃子。その、よろしく。", "zh": "诶？　嗯、嗯……  \n我叫周防桃子。那个，请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0117_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_01_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "039a224c639e318cf4a818ac04a97f9d54dc8a92ba22880c476a540584faea10", "ja": "それで親分さんは、今、どちらに……？", "zh": "那么，老大现在在哪儿……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
